    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβά̆τ-ης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>, a
		kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>half-boot of felt</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				12.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Duris
				14J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόθορνος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>JTr.</u>
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				64.98
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>modulus</i> or <i>unit of measurement</i> in Greek
			architecture, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				4.3.3
			</span></i>.</div>
